{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling: S4 no longer waits for archive diagnosis 64552d40 to close\n\n8a78f701 held S4 (the outside-effect driver, packages/scope/src/operations.ts) until 64552d40 closed, because both sit in the scope runtime. Under ruling 677da3fe, 64552d40 closes only when the retry recurs with its new logging. That condition may never arrive, so the hold could last indefinitely. Since M4 (8d9080f3), the full gates for M5, M6, M7, S1 and S3 ran the same archive owners, and no workroom act reports a recurrence.\n\nThe archive-scale owner's retry comes from the journal archive path, not from the outside-effect driver. operations.ts has not changed since the audit at e50d9eeb.\n\nDecision:\n1. S4 starts in lane C now, as the next request names.\n2. 64552d40 stays open as a watch. Its logging stays in place, and S4 must not change archive or fold code.\n3. If any gate, including S4's, shows the archive-scale owner answering retry, retain that gate's evidence under 64552d40 and stop S4 until the planner classifies the failure.\n4. Before S4's review request, report in one line whether each full gate since 8d9080f3 that you still hold shows any archive retry. Name each gate."}